      "source": "<strong>NOTE:</strong> This annotation cannot be used in conjunction with\nother <code>@RequestMapping</code> annotations that are declared on the same method.\nIf multiple <code>@RequestMapping</code> annotations are detected on the same method,\na warning will be logged, and only the first mapping will be used. This applies\nto <code>@RequestMapping</code> as well as composed <code>@RequestMapping</code> annotations\nsuch as <code>@GetMapping</code>, <code>@PostMapping</code>, etc.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong> 此注解不能与同一方法上声明的其他 <code>@RequestMapping</code> 注解一起使用。如果在同一方法上检测到多个 <code>@RequestMapping</code> 注解，将记录警告信息，并且仅使用第一个映射。此规则同样适用于 <code>@RequestMapping</code> 以及组合的 <code>@RequestMapping</code> 注解，例如 <code>@GetMapping</code>、<code>@PostMapping</code> 等。",
